    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d598-a2">

                <pb facs="0587" n="513" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg513"/>

                <head>[Telegram.—Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ferrol,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-03-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 6, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the Charge d’Affaires of the United States:</hi></p>
                <p>Captain of English merchantman Clyde, two months in port, told me the greater
                    part of the crew had shipped on the Stonewall. What am I to do?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FERNANDEZ.</signed><lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">March</hi> 6. <lb/>
                    <signed>EDUARDO URICH, <hi rendition="#italic">Chief on
                    Service.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
